<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>Stocks-Markets-Economic Times</title><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks</link><description><![CDATA[Stock Market News: Latest Stock news and updates on The Economic Times. Find Stock Market Live Updates, BSE, NSE Top Gainers, Losers and more.]]> </description><language>en-gb</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 02:56:55 +0530</lastBuildDate><atom:link type="application/rss+xml" rel="self" href="https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/rssfeeds/2146842.cms"/><copyright>Copyright:(C) 2026 Bennett Coleman and Co. Ltd, http://info.indiatimes.com/terms/tou.html</copyright><docs>http://syndication.indiatimes.com/</docs><image><title>Economic Times</title><url>https://img.etimg.com/thumb/msid-76939477,width-600,height-60/economictimes.jpg</url><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks</link></image><item><title><![CDATA[5 penny stocks plunge up to 68% in six months. Do you own any?]]> </title><description><![CDATA[Five BSE Smallcap penny stocks have fallen between 21% and 68% in recent months. Kalind and Empower India led the declines, plunging 68% and 62%, respectively.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/5-penny-stocks-plunge-up-to-68-in-six-months-do-you-own-any/slideshow/136069072.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-136068975,imgsize-10749.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/5-penny-stocks-plunge-up-to-68-in-six-months-do-you-own-any/slideshow/136069072.cms</guid><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 12:03:45 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Reliance Brands FY26 revenue up 3.8% to Rs 3,390.9 crore; loss narrows to Rs 137 crore]]> </title><description><![CDATA[Reliance Brands has marked a significant financial milestone, achieving a revenue of Rs 3,390.89 crore for FY26 and reducing losses. Operating more than 1,085 Points of Sale nationwide, the brand continues to collaborate with over 90 partner names. Recent acquisitions, including Hamleys and new entries like Stella McCartney and Fabletics, demonstrate the company’s drive to lead in the competitive fashion and lifestyle industry.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/earnings/reliance-brands-fy26-revenue-up-3-8-to-rs-3390-9-crore-loss-narrows-to-rs-137-crore/articleshow/136068185.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-136068185,imgsize-169960.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/earnings/reliance-brands-fy26-revenue-up-3-8-to-rs-3390-9-crore-loss-narrows-to-rs-137-crore/articleshow/136068185.cms</guid><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 11:14:52 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Nifty eyes 26,200 as rally strengthens; 6 sectors signal outperformance]]> </title><description><![CDATA[Nifty surged 2.61% last week, gaining 656 points amid strong FII inflows and improving technical indicators. Resistance lies at 25,950–26,200, while banking, IT and financial services lead sectoral momentum. Analysts advise caution against chasing extended market gains.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/nifty-eyes-26200-as-rally-strengthens-6-sectors-signal-outperformance/articleshow/136050218.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-136050218,imgsize-154742.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/nifty-eyes-26200-as-rally-strengthens-6-sectors-signal-outperformance/articleshow/136050218.cms</guid><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 15:09:05 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Stocks to buy: HSBC lists 19 Indian stocks that saw FY27 earnings upgrades, check target prices]]> </title><description><![CDATA[HSBC identified 19 Indian stocks with Buy ratings that received FY27 earnings upgrades after Q2 results. Ather Energy, GAIL and IIFL Finance led revisions, while improving corporate profitability highlighted a broadening earnings recovery across market capitalisations and sectors.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/stocks-to-buy-hsbc-lists-19-indian-stocks-that-saw-fy27-earnings-upgrades-check-target-prices/slideshow/136048231.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-136048024,imgsize-88698.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/stocks-to-buy-hsbc-lists-19-indian-stocks-that-saw-fy27-earnings-upgrades-check-target-prices/slideshow/136048231.cms</guid><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 12:51:34 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Concurrent Gainers: These 13 stocks gained for 5 days in a row, all rose over 27%]]> </title><description><![CDATA[The Sensex gained 1.08% during the five sessions ending November 20, while 99 BSE 200 stocks advanced consecutively. Thirteen shortlisted stocks delivered impressive cumulative returns ranging from 27.51% to 31.02%, led by Sera Investments &amp; Finance India.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/concurrent-gainers-these-13-stocks-gained-for-5-days-in-a-row-all-rose-over-27/slideshow/136047969.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-136047592,imgsize-12149.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/concurrent-gainers-these-13-stocks-gained-for-5-days-in-a-row-all-rose-over-27/slideshow/136047969.cms</guid><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 12:27:10 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[AI to lead investment strategy in 2027; Energy and borrowing costs shape macro outlook: Barclays]]> </title><description><![CDATA[According to the latest report from Barclays Private Bank, the impending year 2027 calls for a stronger investment focus on artificial intelligence. While infrastructure is steadily developing, the rising costs of debt financing could negatively impact the economics of these projects. The report warns of potential computing demand outpacing supply, which may hinder technology scalability. Investors should approach government bonds with caution due to elevated yields and inflation worries.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/ai-to-lead-investment-strategy-in-2027-energy-and-borrowing-costs-shape-macro-outlook-barclays/articleshow/136046648.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-136046648,imgsize-183490.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/ai-to-lead-investment-strategy-in-2027-energy-and-borrowing-costs-shape-macro-outlook-barclays/articleshow/136046648.cms</guid><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 11:39:54 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Market winners: Max Healthcare, Deepak Fertilisers among 10 stocks that surged up to 14% in last week]]> </title><description><![CDATA[Max Healthcare, Deepak Fertilisers and Blue Star led Nifty 500 weekly gainers, surging 14.14%, 13.90% and 12.84%, respectively. Ten stocks outperformed the broader index, which gained 1.5%, highlighting strong momentum across healthcare, banking, real estate and other sectors.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/market-winners-max-healthcare-deepak-fertilisers-among-10-stocks-that-surged-up-to-14-in-last-week/slideshow/136046616.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-136046194,imgsize-29944.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/market-winners-max-healthcare-deepak-fertilisers-among-10-stocks-that-surged-up-to-14-in-last-week/slideshow/136046616.cms</guid><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 11:21:22 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Sebi proposes limiting tenure of chief executives, independent directors of stock exchanges, market infrastruction institutions]]> </title><description><![CDATA[India's Securities and Exchange Board is proposing crucial adjustments to governance norms affecting market institutions. Key suggestions include lowering the age threshold for public interest directors from 75 to 70 years, instituting a maximum of two three-year terms for directors, and restricting managing directors to an eight-year tenure. Current executives can finish their ongoing terms despite these proposed changes. SEBI is seeking public feedback on these recommendations by December 11.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/sebi-proposes-limiting-tenure-of-chief-executives-independent-directors-at-exchanges/articleshow/136031465.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-136031465,imgsize-168964.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/sebi-proposes-limiting-tenure-of-chief-executives-independent-directors-at-exchanges/articleshow/136031465.cms</guid><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 20:39:36 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Sebi plans consultation paper to remove FPI constraints absent in other markets]]> </title><description><![CDATA[SEBI is set to release a consultation paper aimed at simplifying regulations for foreign portfolio investors. The goal is to eliminate certain compliance restrictions to enhance India's appeal to global investors. SEBI also plans to expedite the onboarding process, targeting completion in just five business days. Additionally, KYC review cycles for applicable FPIs will be extended, reducing repetitive compliance activities.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/sebi-plans-consultation-paper-to-remove-fpi-constraints-absent-in-other-markets/articleshow/136020808.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-136020808,imgsize-41262.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/sebi-plans-consultation-paper-to-remove-fpi-constraints-absent-in-other-markets/articleshow/136020808.cms</guid><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 14:49:53 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Indian finance hub eyes dual share model to kickstart public offers: Report]]> </title><description><![CDATA[Indian regulators are currently assessing a new proposal that would allow companies to introduce dual-class shares for listings in both domestic markets and GIFT City. This initiative seeks to invigorate equity market activity in GIFT City, which has faced challenges regarding limited primary market participation. One class of shares would be traded in rupees, while the other would be dollar-denominated, granting foreign investors easier access alongside reduced tax implications.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/indian-finance-hub-eyes-dual-share-model-to-kickstart-public-offers-report/articleshow/136017941.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-136017941,imgsize-147888.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/indian-finance-hub-eyes-dual-share-model-to-kickstart-public-offers-report/articleshow/136017941.cms</guid><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 13:02:59 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Sun Pharma Share Price Live Updates: Sun Pharma Stock Price History]]> </title><description><![CDATA[]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/stock-liveblog/sun-pharma-stock-price-livestock-price-today-live-updates-20-nov-2026/liveblog/136016959.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-136016959,imgsize-72289.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/stock-liveblog/sun-pharma-stock-price-livestock-price-today-live-updates-20-nov-2026/liveblog/136016959.cms</guid><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 12:19:25 +0530</pubDate></item><item><tit